id: inherited-aggression
name: Inherited Aggression
order: 2
optionOf: warrior-of-two-worlds
description: >
  For each Health Threshold an Opponent is below, increase your Wound Rolls against them by 1(bT).
text: >
  Inherited Aggression [Passive]: For each Health Threshold an Opponent is below, increase your Wound Rolls against them by 1(bT).

---

# (3) Against each one it reaches, by their own Health Threshold - where the Wound is worked out per target (chat.mjs).
[passive]
wound.perTargetThreshold += 1(bT);

# (4) An Opponent knocked through a Health Threshold by your Attacking Maneuver: a stack of Battle Born, yours to put.
[triggered/knock-through, 1/encounter, effect 4]
gainOneOf(battlebornstrike, battleborndodge, battlebornwound);
